add(R, `다음 대화의 빈칸에 들어갈 말을 <보기>에서 골라 차례대로 배열한 것은?\n\nG: Jaemin, are you ready for the singing contest?\nB: ______________________________\nG: Why? I thought you really wanted to take part in the contest.\nB: I don't think I'm a good singer.\nG: Come on. ______________________________\nB: Do you really think so?\nG: Of course. You have a really nice voice.\nB: ______________________________\nG: I'm sure you'll do great.\nB: Ok. I'll do my best.\nG: ______________________________\n\n<보기>\nⓐ You're the best singer I know.\nⓑ Well, I'm thinking of giving up.\nⓒ Thank you for saying so.\nⓓ I hope you win the contest.`, '1', ['ⓑ-ⓐ-ⓒ-ⓓ', 'ⓑ-ⓐ-ⓓ-ⓒ', 'ⓒ-ⓐ-ⓑ-ⓓ', 'ⓓ-ⓐ-ⓒ-ⓑ', 'ⓓ-ⓒ-ⓐ-ⓑ']);
