const STAR148 = `(A) I bought star-shaped pieces of paper for my students. On each star, I wrote a short message, beginning with "You are a star because ..."\n(B) I was the first person to tell her that in her life. The thought had never even crossed her mind until she read that star. It was by far the single greatest moment in my life. The stars were definitely worth my time.\n(C) One of my students, Lucy, showed slow progress during the year. She was smart in her own way, though. On her star, I wrote, "You are a star because you are smart and you can do anything you put your mind to. Don't forget that."\n(D) After I gave out the stars, Lucy approached me, holding her star in her hand. She was crying. "Mr. Porter, do you think I am smart?" was her question. She said, "I had always thought that I wasn't good at anything before you gave me the message on the star. I didn't have any courage to try something and any confidence about myself. But your message changed that thought. I think I can do anything if I try. Thank you so much, Mr. Porter."`;
